# Belt and braces: if any repo doc is ever served, keep it out of search results.
/CLAUDE.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/README.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/assets/README.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/worker/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/tools/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/unsubscribe/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
